# JFK Liquors — Design & Engineering Rules (rules.jfk)
# NEVER VIOLATE THESE RULES UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES

## 1. Color System (Strict Palette)
- **Primary Background**: Midnight Black (`#111111` or `#0A0A0A`). Complete deep black on Hero.
- **Brand Accent / Highlights / CTAs**: Liquor Store Gold (`#F5D900`). Used intentionally for primary buttons, highlighted text, and key accents.
- **Elevated Surfaces / Cards / Nav / Footer**: Charcoal (`#242424`). Borders are subtle `#383838` or `#2E2E2E`.
- **Secondary Accent / Premium Sections**: Deep Burgundy (`#5B1018`). Used for promotional drop banners and announcement strip.
- **Text & Contrast**: Clean White (`#FFFFFF`) for primary headings & body, muted silver (`#A0A0A0` / `#C7C7C7`) for secondary copy.

## 2. Typography Rules
- **Brand Editorial Headings (Strict)**: Use `Anton` (`font-anton` / `font-heading`) for ALL headings across the entire website (Hero, Cards, Section titles, Product detail titles) in bold, uppercase impact.
- **Body & All Content (Strict)**: Use `Montserrat` (`font-sans` / `font-montserrat`) for ALL body text, paragraphs, tags, buttons, valuations, product details, and navigation.

## 3. Homepage Department Cards Rules
- **Standalone Image**: Images must stand alone, crisp and strong (`relative aspect-[4/3]`). NEVER place text or dark gradient blankets on top of the images.
- **Detail Below Image**: Department title in Anton, subtitle in Montserrat gold uppercase, description in Montserrat, and explore link are strictly positioned below the photo container.
- **Navigation**: Each card links directly to `/products/[category]` with prefetching for instant page load.

## 4. Product Detail Page Rules
- **Interactive Multi-Image Gallery**: If a product has multiple preview images, users MUST be able to click any thumbnail to instantly swap the main displayed bottle photo, complete with active gold ring state.
- **Minimalist Presentation**: The bottle photo is the hero (`aspect-[3/4] sm:aspect-[4/5]`). No AI-slop boilerplate tables or unnecessary ribbons.
- **Mandatory Compliance Notice**: Every product detail and collection page must display:
  `Stock changes daily. Call +1 281-590-3300 to check availability. Must be 21+ with valid ID.`
- **3-Cards-Per-Row**: Related products and catalog grids always use 3 columns on desktop (`grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8`).

## 5. Performance & Fast Page Changes
- **Instant Pre-Fetching**: Always specify `prefetch={true}` on all primary navigation and product `<Link>` elements.
- **Instant Fallback**: Data fetching functions must return in-memory mock data with 0ms delay if external databases are unreachable.

## 3. Hero Section Rules
- **Background**: Complete black background (`#050505` / `#111111`).
- **Main Visual**: Must be clearly visible and clean with no black overlay/backdrop masking the photography.
- **Heading Line Spacing**: Multi-line block elements with distinct vertical margin (`mt-1.5 sm:mt-2.5`) and comfortable line height (`leading-[1.2] sm:leading-[1.22]`).
- **No Divider / Info Strip Under Hero**: Do NOT place horizontal ticker strips (`InfoBand`) directly under the hero. Viewport flows directly into the curated department gallery.

## 4. Product Cards & Grid Layout Rules
- **3 Cards in a Row**: Product and Vault exhibition cards MUST always be laid out in 3 columns on desktop (`grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8`), providing generous width and high-impact bottle photography.
- **Card Typography**: Tags, descriptions, pricing, and CTA buttons strictly use `Montserrat` (`font-sans`). Only bottle titles use `Playfair Display` (`font-serif`).

## 5. Responsive Spatial Width (Big Screens)
- **Container Sizing**: NEVER constrain containers to narrow `max-w-7xl` (1280px), which leaves massive empty black borders on 1440p/4K monitors. Use `max-w-[1680px]` with progressive padding `px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16 2xl:px-20` to fill large screens with balanced luxury breathing room.

## 4. Navigation Bar Rules (Luxury & Professional, Never "Beginner")
- Sleek sticky navbar with deep black backdrop blur (`#050505`/95).
- Clean JFK logo sizing (`h-8 sm:h-9`, sharp object-contain). NO extraneous coordinate badges or wrapping tags beside the logo.
- Exactly 4-5 concise, spaced menu links with `whitespace-nowrap`: `The Vault` (dropdown), `Departments`, `Delivery`, `Our Story`, `Contact`.
- Right side: Clean, single-line phone `(281) 590-3300` and compact gold `Visit Us ↗` button. Everything strictly `whitespace-nowrap flex-shrink-0` — NEVER let text wrap into two broken lines.

## 5. Anti-Slop & Minimalism Rules
- **NO Emojis anywhere** in the UI. Use sleek minimal vector SVG icons only where necessary.
- **NO Childish AI-slop widgets**, multiple slider pagination dots, or clutter in the hero section.
- **Bottles are the star**: Real, high-resolution bottle photography with deep dark vignettes and crisp pricing.
- **Subtle animations only**: Clean hover transitions (opacity, scale-102, smooth color shift). No jarring or excessive motion.

## 6. Specific Section Signatures
- **Info Band**: Must follow the 3-column format from `media_1793930307892_3e245bf0.png`:
  - `MON–SAT 11:00 AM — 9:00 PM • SUN CLOSED` (with `SUN CLOSED` in gold)
  - `FIND US ON UBER EATS + DOORDASH` (Uber Eats in `#67cb89`, DoorDash in `#ff6451`)
  - `CALL THE STORE (281) 590-3300 ↗` (with `(281) 590-3300 ↗` in gold)
- **Delivery Section**: Must follow `media_1793930349960_4d1ceb70.png`:
  - Eyebrow: `YOUR FAVORITES, DELIVERED`
  - Headline: `STAYING IN?` in white, `WE'VE GOT OPTIONS.` in `#F5D900` gold in Anton display font.
  - Charcoal cards for Uber Eats & DoorDash with `Open Uber Eats ↗` and `Open DoorDash ↗`.

## 7. Awwwards-Level Design Standards
- **NO Generic Top Announcement Bars**: NEVER put e-commerce announcement ribbons across the top of the site. The viewport must open directly into the cinematic header and hero for an immersive, awards-worthy first impression.
- **Micro-Typography**: Use fine index notation (e.g. `[ 29.9844° N, 95.3414° W ]`, `01 // ARCHIVE`, `VOL. XXIV`) with delicate letter-spacing (`tracking-[0.25em]`).
- **Precision Spacing & Layout**: Generous whitespace, asymmetric editorial tension, flawless grid alignment, ultra-thin 1px borders (`rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` or `#262626`).
- **Tactile Depth**: Use deep Obsidian Black (`#0A0A0A` / `#111111`), delicate gold accents, subtle radial atmospheric glows, and razor-sharp bottle photography.
